                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="legend-notes" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;— IAM (global): GitHub OIDC provider + circleguard-gha-role, assumed by GitHub Actions (see CI/CD view).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;— S3 circleguard-tfstate holds Terraform remote state, written by local terraform apply (not CI).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;— Data-plane StatefulSets (PostgreSQL, Neo4j, Kafka, Zookeeper, Redis, OpenLDAP, MailHog) run as pods with EBS gp2 PVCs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;— Observability runs in-cluster per namespace: Prometheus · Grafana · AlertManager · Jaeger · ELK (Elasticsearch + Kibana + Filebeat) · kube-state-metrics.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;— Namespaces dev/stage/prod are logical (K8s), not network boundaries.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E8E8E8);" parent="legend-container" vertex="1">
